,198],"messages":[{"content":"Solve the problem step by step. Give your final answer in \\boxed{...}.\n\nFind the sum of all the rational terms in the expansion of\n\\[(\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3})^{12}.\\]","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"6364e41f4fc21957083edfc75cfc95384e3a03dd0171dc3d6c8af19ab06d63d1"},"seconds":38.9896399974823,"seed":479069072146413730,"stop":"eos","text":"To find the sum of all the rational terms in the expansion of \\((\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3})^{12}\\), we need to analyze the general term in the binomial expansion. The binomial theorem states that:\n\n\\[\n(\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3})^{12} = \\sum_{k=0}^{12} \\binom{12}{k} (\\sqrt{2})^{12-k} (\\sqrt[3]{3})^k.\n\\]\n\nThe general term in this expansion is:\n\n\\[\n\\binom{12}{k} (\\sqrt{2})^{12-k} (\\sqrt[3]{3})^k.\n\\]\n\nFor the term to be rational, both \\((\\sqrt{2})^{12-k}\\) and \\((\\sqrt[3]{3})^k\\) must result in rational numbers. This means that \\(12-k\\) must be even (since \\((\\sqrt{2})^{12-k}\\) will be rational if and only if \\(12-k\\) is even) and \\(k\\) must be a multiple of 3 (since \\((\\sqrt[3]{3})^k\\) will be rational if and only if \\(k\\) is a multiple of 3).\n\nLet's find the values of \\(k\\) that satisfy both conditions. The possible values of \\(k\\) are the multiples of 3 that are also such that \\(12-k\\) is even. These values are \\(k = 0, 6, 12\\).\n\nNow, we will calculate the corresponding terms:\n\n1. For \\(k = 0\\):\n\\[\n\\binom{12}{0} (\\sqrt{2})^{12} (\\sqrt[3]{3})^0 = 1 \\cdot 2^6 \\cdot 1 = 64.\n\\]\n\n2. For \\(k = 6\\):\n\\[\n\\binom{12}{6} (\\sqrt{2})^6 (\\sqrt[3]{3})^6 = 924 \\cdot 2^3 \\cdot 3^2 = 924 \\cdot 8 \\cdot 9 = 924 \\cdot 72 = 66528.\n\\]\n\n3. For \\(k = 12\\):\n\\[\n\\binom{12}{12} (\\sqrt{2})^0 (\\sqrt[3]{3})^{12} = 1 \\cdot 1 \\cdot 3^4 = 81.\n\\]\n\nAdding these rational terms together, we get:\n\\[\n64 + 66528 + 81 = 66673.\n\\]\n\nThus, the sum of all the rational terms in the expansion of \\((\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt[3]{3})^{12}\\) is \\(\\boxed{66673}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{66673}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
